DECL	{"args":[{"name":"u","sort":{"sort":"track"}}],"body":{"cmp":"le","lhs":{"args":[{"var":"u"}],"measure":"kin_speed"},"rhs":{"param":"speed_tolerance"}},"contract":"The road user is motionless at the observation: the magnitude of its velocity is at most the speed tolerance, a speed the caller sets, so that a sampled reading at or below it is read as no movement at all. The definition this contract carries requires a “complete cessation from movement”, and because speed is sampled and measured with error, the tolerance is the bound within which a reading is read as that cessation; it is the contract's own magnitude and never a figure. The concept states the motion state at the observation and nothing else. Not a stand-in for: a halt of any duration or a halt repeated over a window, a vehicle standing, parked or waiting, the engine being off or a brake being applied, or a halt at a place a law names — it carries no place, no duration and no control state.","definition":"DEF-NRS-484A-255","id":"drv.motion.standstill","kind":"formula","narrowings":[],"params":[{"name":"speed_tolerance","unit":"metre_per_second"}],"residues":["The definition's scope clause tells which of the two posted definitions of the word applies to a given law — the one for a stop that is required rather than prohibited. It is a rule of application, not a condition of the scene, and no observation decides it."],"supersedes":null}
ATOMS	kin_speed
READS	kin_speed
AGGREGATES	
HARDAGG	
BODY	{"cmp":"le","lhs":{"args":[{"var":"u"}],"measure":"kin_speed"},"rhs":{"param":"speed_tolerance"}}
WITNESS	holds	drv.motion.standstill@w
WITNESS	fails	drv.motion.standstill@w
WITNESS	blind	drv.motion.standstill@w
OCC	u
INST	drv.motion.standstill@w	ok
TIME	checks	3
TIME	lint	6
SCEN	holds	drv.motion.standstill@w	compliant	compliant	ok
TIME	scenario:drv.motion.standstill@w/holds	8
SCEN	fails	drv.motion.standstill@w	violated	violated	ok
TIME	scenario:drv.motion.standstill@w/fails	8
SCEN	blind	drv.motion.standstill@w	unknown	unknown	ok
TIME	scenario:drv.motion.standstill@w/blind	10
TIME	witnesses	26
DONE_WITNESSES
